# The release archives ship this one: the operator-facing quickstart.
!packaging/QUICKSTART.txt
# Test data, not temp output: pins the response-envelope migration backlog
# (see TestSuccessEnvelope). It has to be committed or the gate cannot pass.
!internal/server/envelope_baseline.txt
# Same reason: the per-file count of raw error bodies (TestErrorEnvelope).
!internal/server/envelope_error_baseline.txt
!README.md
# The lint debt ceiling is checked in on purpose (see scripts/check-lint-debt.sh).
!scripts/lint-backlog.txt
!scripts/openapi-debt.txt

